    body_rest: 'I build n8n, Clay and HubSpot workflows and could take one small scoped task from a client project, delivered under your brand, so you can judge the work first. Relevant proof: ' + proofSentence(AGENCY_PROOFS[0]),
    follow_up_1: fn + ', one concrete option: a single enrichment or CRM sync task from a current client, fixed scope, under your brand. Worth a look?',
    follow_up_2: fn + ', I can send a short Loom of a recent build so you can judge the quality first.',
    follow_up_3: fn + ', closing the loop. Happy to help when capacity gets tight.',
    linkedin_note: 'Hi ' + fn + ', I build n8n, Clay and HubSpot workflows and take scoped tasks from agency client work under your brand. Open to one small first task?'
